"Reintroduce the :class:`types.EllipsisType`, :class:`types.NoneType` and :"
"class:`types.NotImplementedType` classes, providing a new set of types "
"readily interpretable by type checkers. (Contributed by Bas van Beek in :"
"issue:`41810`.)"
